          "audioPreviewUrl": "https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/cards/9zMx5/preview sing motion picture soundtrack-1.mp3",
          "description": " Get ready to sing your heart out and dance like nobody’s watching! \n\nThe Sing Original Motion Picture Soundtrack brings together some of the biggest, most feel-good hits that the whole family can enjoy. With a mix of pop, rock, soul, and a few heartfelt ballads, this album is packed with memorable performances by your favorite animated stars — from the soulful confident porcupine Ash to the piano-playing gorilla Johnny.\n \nWhether you're singing “Shake It Off” in the car or listening to “Hallelujah” during a quiet moment, this collection has something for every mood. It's got all the energy, heart, and fun of the movie—it’s a full-on musical party waiting to happen. So turn it up, let your inner superstar shine, and SING!\n",
